{title: A Cristo coronad}
{key: G}

{comment: Verso 1}
[C]A Cristo [F]coronad,
[C]Divino [Dm]Salva[G]dor;
[C]Sentado en [D]alta [D7]majest[G]ad,
[C]Es [G]digno [C][D7]de [G]loor.
Al [C]Rey de [C7]gloria y [F]paz[D]
[D7]Loores [G]tributad,
Y [C]bendec[Am]id al [Dm]inmort[C]al
Por [F]toda [G]eter[G7]nidad[C].

{comment: Verso 2}
[C]A Cristo [F]coronad,
[C]Señor [Dm]de [G]nuestro amor
Al [C]Rey [D]triunfante [D7][G]celebrad,
[C]Glor[G]ioso [C][D7]vence[G]dor.
[C]Potente rey [C7]de paz,[F]   [D]
El [D7]triunfo [G]consumó,
Y [C]por su [Am]muerte [Dm]de [C]dolor,
Su [F]gran [G]amor [G7]most[C]ró.

{comment: Verso 3}
[C]A Cristo [F]coronad,
[C]Señor [Dm]de [G]vida y luz,
Con [C]alabanz[D]as [D7]proclamad[G]
[C]Los [G]tri[C]unf[D7]os [G]de la cruz.
A Él [C]sólo [C7]adorad,  [F]   [D]
[D7]Señor de [G]salvación;
[C]Loor [Am]eterno [Dm]tributad[C]
De [F]todo [G]coraz[G7]ón. [C]
